&lt;p style="margin-left: 54px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 66px; line-height: 12px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
